Read AGENTS.md first. It is the single source of truth for all AI agents/models
working on Speed4You. The project is a React + Express + PostgreSQL ISP streaming
portal at https://github.com/jonyspeednet-alt/isp-entertainment-portal.

Required reading order at the start of any task:
1. AGENTS.md
2. worklog.md
3. TODO.md
4. plan.md

Required update order at the end of any task:
1. plan.md
2. TODO.md
3. worklog.md
4. git add <specific files> + git commit (Conventional Commits)

Key conventions: CommonJS in backend, ES modules in frontend, React 18 functional
components only, Joi validation on every route, never edit files under
backend/src/data/ or node_modules/. See AGENTS.md for the full ruleset.

If you need a credential or ***REMOVED***: read AGENTS.md §17, then run
`npm run ***REMOVED***s:check`. Never grep for `.env`/***REMOVED***s/keys, never search
git history, never try common defaults. If the ***REMOVED*** is missing, ask the user.
